["<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">tool_search(queries, limit?)   search the deferred-tool catalog (one or more queries)</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">tool_describe(names)           load the full schemas for one or more tools</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">tool_call(calls)               invoke deferred tools; `calls` is an array of {name, arguments}</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Model: tool_search([&quot;create a github issue&quot;, &quot;send a slack message&quot;])</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  → { results: [ { query: &quot;create a github issue&quot;,</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">                   matches: [&quot;mcp_github_create_issue&quot;, ...] },</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">                 { query: &quot;send a slack message&quot;,</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">                   matches: [&quot;mcp_slack_post_message&quot;, ...] } ],</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">      tools: { mcp_github_create_issue: { description: &quot;...&quot;,</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">                              